[27.591, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.141, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Got it — no rename. Converting in place as `vm-05`.\r\n"]
[29.141, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Important find before I wipe anything: vm-05 runs a scheduled S3 backup\r\n"]
[30.041, "o", "  (`~/scripts/homelab-backup.sh` + its key). Preserving that first.\r\n"]
[31.241, "o", "\r\n"]
[31.791, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  scp -p vm-05:~/scripts/homelab-backup.sh ./salvage/\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.491, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Salvaging…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(12s · ↓ 0.8k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[34.491, "o", "\r\n"]
[35.041, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Now writing the vm-05 config, then checking it evaluates.\r\n"]
[36.041, "o", "\r\n"]
[36.591, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  nix eval .#nixosConfigurations.vm-05.config.system.build.toplevel\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[37.291, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Evaluating…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(41s · ↓ 2.6k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.291, "o", "\r\n"]
[39.841, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Config evaluates cleanly. Committing to the repo.\r\n"]
[40.941, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Now the kexec phase — this is the point of no return for vm-05's\r\n"]
[41.841, "o", "  Debian install.\r\n"]
[43.041, "o", "\r\n"]
[43.591, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  nixos-anywhere --flake .#vm-05 root@vm-05\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[44.291, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Installing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(1m 04s · ↓ 3.4k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[46.291, "o", "\r\n"]
[46.841, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Kexec was rejected: Secure Boot is enabled on this VM, so the kernel\r\n"]
[47.741, "o", "  refuses to load the unsigned NixOS kernel. Checking how boxed-in we are.\r\n"]
[48.941, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Investigating…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(27s · ↓ 1.9k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[50.941, "o", "\r\n"]
[51.491, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Blocked on a real fork. vm-05 is a Gen-2 VM with Secure Boot On, and the\r\n"]
[52.391, "o", "  kernel is in `integrity` lockdown — that blocks both kexec paths, so the\r\n"]
[53.291, "o", "  install can't start. NixOS also can't Secure Boot without lanzaboote.\r\n"]
[54.591, "o", "\r\n"]
[55.141, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220m\u001b[1mI can disable Secure Boot from the hypervisor and power-cycle it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.041, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mThat reboots vm-05. Say go and I'll do it.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[56.641, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[59.841, "o", "\r\n"]
[60.391, "o", "\u001b[38;5;37m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── nixos-vm-05\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[60.891, "o", "\u001b[38;5;114m❯\u001b[0m "]
[61.591, "o", "\u001b"]
[61.676, "o", "["]
[61.787, "o", "3"]
[61.881, "o", "8"]
[61.962, "o", ";"]
[62.05, "o", "5"]
[62.142, "o", ";"]
[62.191, "o", "2"]
[62.299, "o", "5"]
[62.399, "o", "3"]
[62.505, "o", "m"]
[62.606, "o", "g"]
[62.678, "o", "o"]
[62.751, "o", " "]
[62.803, "o", "a"]
[62.893, "o", "h"]
[62.942, "o", "e"]
[62.992, "o", "a"]
[63.051, "o", "d"]
[63.108, "o", "\u001b"]
[63.177, "o", "["]
[63.225, "o", "0"]
[63.27, "o", "m"]
[63.326, "o", "\r\n"]
[65.126, "o", "\r\n"]
[65.676, "o", "\r\n"]
[66.226, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  ssh hv-01 powershell -c \"Set-VMFirmware vm-05 -EnableSecureBoot Off\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[66.926, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Reconfiguring…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(34s · ↓ 1.1k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[68.926, "o", "\r\n"]
[69.476, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Lockdown is now `[none]` — kexec will work. Re-running.\r\n"]
[70.476, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Installing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(2m 11s · ↓ 4.2k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[72.476, "o", "\r\n"]
[73.026, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Mid-kexec, host unreachable as expected. But it never came back.\r\n"]
[74.126, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m I have hypervisor access, so let me grab the VM console screen directly.\r\n"]
[75.126, "o", "\r\n"]
[75.676, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mBash  ssh hv-01 powershell -c \"Get-VMConsole vm-05 | Out-File screen.txt\"\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[76.376, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Capturing…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(19s · ↓ 1.5k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[78.376, "o", "\r\n"]
[78.926, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Found it — the console shows the kexec kernel booted but\r\n"]
[79.826, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;220mInitramfs unpacking failed: XZ-compressed data is corrupt\u001b[0m, then hung.\r\n"]
[80.726, "o", "  That's the classic symptom of too little RAM to unpack the ~430 MB\r\n"]
[81.626, "o", "  installer initrd. vm-05 has 4 GB. Bumping it temporarily to 8 GB.\r\n"]
[82.826, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Retrying…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(3m 48s · ↓ 5.7k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[84.826, "o", "\r\n"]
[85.376, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Host is answering — connection refused, not unreachable. It's booting,\r\n"]
[86.276, "o", "  sshd not up yet.\r\n"]
[87.376, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;114mvm-05 is up on NixOS 26.11\u001b[0m, booted from disk, both NICs and the IPv6\r\n"]
[88.276, "o", "  address correct. Two things to check — DNS is failing.\r\n"]
[89.476, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Found the real issue: private names fail while public names work.\r\n"]
[90.376, "o", "  systemd-resolved is routing queries to its fallback instead of the local\r\n"]
[91.276, "o", "  resolver, because nothing marks the interface's DNS as authoritative.\r\n"]
[92.276, "o", "  Fixing that in the config, not by hand on the box.\r\n"]
[93.476, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Rebuilding…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(58s · ↓ 2.2k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[95.476, "o", "\r\n"]
[96.026, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m Now restoring the VM to its original 4 GB and doing a cold boot — the\r\n"]
[96.926, "o", "  real test that it comes up unattended.\r\n"]
[98.126, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m· Verifying…\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246m(1m 27s · ↓ 3.0k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[100.126, "o", "\r\n"]
[100.676, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;114mEverything verified.\u001b[0m vm-05 runs NixOS 26.11, converted entirely over\r\n"]
[101.576, "o", "  SSH. Disk layout, both NICs, IPv6, DNS and the cluster agent all check out\r\n"]
[102.476, "o", "  after a cold boot at the original 4 GB. Config committed and pushed.\r\n"]
[103.876, "o", "\r\n"]
[104.426, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246m8 of 9 nodes converted.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
